WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,010 --> 00:00:07,970
I remember the moving truck from the county seat to Song Yaqin’s natal town

2
00:00:07,970 --> 00:00:09,330
It's the first flight at nine o'clock in the morning

3
00:00:09,330 --> 00:00:10,610
One flight at four o'clock in the afternoon

4
00:00:10,610 --> 00:00:11,690
It's past twelve o'clock now

5
00:00:11,690 --> 00:00:13,330
We arrived at the county seat at about two o'clock

6
00:00:13,330 --> 00:00:14,570
There are two hours

7
00:00:14,570 --> 00:00:16,130
Finding ways to sell people is scary and painful

8
00:00:16,130 --> 00:00:27,230
You sit too

9
00:00:27,230 --> 00:00:32,090
Dad is not tired. Just sit down.

10
00:00:32,090 --> 00:00:35,210
I was deceived into marrying Zhang Jianguo by his sweet words

11
00:00:35,210 --> 00:00:36,290
It turned out later that

12
00:00:36,290 --> 00:00:37,530
This guy is just a street kid

13
00:00:37,530 --> 00:00:39,730
Not only is he not doing his job properly, but it is also difficult and easy.

14
00:00:39,730 --> 00:00:40,970
Because I gave birth to a girl

15
00:00:40,970 --> 00:00:43,130
Divorce me without hesitation after all these years

16
00:00:43,130 --> 00:00:44,570
I'm staying at Zhang's house with my kids

17
00:00:44,570 --> 00:00:46,370
I saw him playing cards every day, eating and waiting to die.

18
00:00:46,570 --> 00:00:48,360
Already hate him thoroughly

19
00:00:48,360 --> 00:00:51,040
I thought this would be like this for the rest of my life. Who would have thought?

20
00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:52,120
He actually changed it

21
00:00:52,120 --> 00:00:53,520
Not only do I go to the sea every day to make money,

22
00:00:53,520 --> 00:00:54,600
Will also take care of the big duck

23
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:56,800
buy me new clothes maybe

24
00:00:56,800 --> 00:01:10,690
You can try to give him another chance

25
00:01:10,690 --> 00:01:12,850
I'll go to the nearby fish market to see if you remember.

26
00:01:12,850 --> 00:01:14,490
No matter who talks to you, ignore it.

27
00:01:14,490 --> 00:01:15,530
Don't even follow them

28
00:01:15,530 --> 00:01:16,690
Dad, Big Duck remembers it

29
00:01:16,690 --> 00:01:17,610
Don't worry

30
00:01:17,610 --> 00:01:18,850
Big duck must be optimistic about my mother

31
00:01:18,850 --> 00:01:20,010
Don't let him because of a piece of candy

32
00:01:20,010 --> 00:01:21,580
He was kidnapped

33
00:01:21,580 --> 00:01:23,060
Who loves sweets?

34
00:01:23,060 --> 00:01:24,620
You still have the nerve to tell others

35
00:01:24,620 --> 00:01:27,120
It's not me anyway

36
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:28,480
Who else could it be if it wasn't you?

37
00:01:28,520 --> 00:01:35,070
You ghost master

38
00:01:35,070 --> 00:01:36,270
Go to Fushan Hotel
